# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets out of it. Anything
# listed here is invisible to the Docker daemon, so a stray .env can never be captured in
# an image layer or leaked to a registry.
#
# Note: config/ is NOT excluded. The Maven build runs checkstyle during `validate`, so the
# ruleset has to be present in the context for `docker build` to succeed.
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
target
src/licenses
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.env
.env.*
*.log
*.md
